# Three Klingon birds of prey fire on three Federation destroyers on layouts/shield-red.jsonc. Each hit's shield effect
# takes the color (1 - s, s, 0) of its target's shield fraction s when it spawns: High (full shields) shows green, Mid
# (half) yellow, and Low (0.15) red-orange. Down starts with its shield generator destroyed and shows the shield-down overlay
# (the dump's shieldDown=true). The first hits land at about 0.85 s.
# Run it with --layout layouts/shield-red.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.2
select AtkHigh
attack High
select AtkMid
attack Mid
select AtkLow
attack Low
wait 0.3
shot down Down 2
wait 0.4
shot high-1 High 2
shot mid-1 Mid 2
shot low-1 Low 2
wait 0.1
shot high-2 High 2
shot mid-2 Mid 2
shot low-2 Low 2
dump after
expect Down ShieldGenerator < 1
